{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And Abraham returned.</b> Where did Isaac go? He sent him off at night because of the evil eye. For thus Hananiah, Mishael, and Azariah — from the time they emerged from the fiery furnace — it is not stated where they went. Some say: to the region where they died, because of the evil eye. And in the name of Rabbi Shimon ben Yehotzadak they said: they changed their place and went to teach Torah before Joshua the High Priest. Thus it is written: ״שמע נא יהושע הכהן הגדול אתה ורעיך היושבים לפניך כי אנשי מופת המה״. What is the meaning of כי אנשי מופת, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:49.182870835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}